WELCOME TO THE HIDDEN SOUND VILLAGE (OTOGAKURE)

You stand in the youngest of the hidden villages, and the only one raised by a single
will — that of Lord Orochimaru. The Sound wears the face of a shinobi village, but its
true purpose is his research. Never forget which is the mask and which is the face.

What the Sound is
Founded in the Land of Sound as a base for Lord Orochimaru's work, the village gathers
strength, subjects, and talent from every nation. We answer to no Kage summit, no
alliance, no law but our founder's. That freedom is bought with secrecy.

Your place in it
- You will be trained, and you will be tested. What you become is the village's to decide.
- You may be offered the Cursed Seal, or asked to serve the research in other ways. To be
  chosen is an honor; to refuse is not an option offered lightly.
- Sound-based and serpent techniques are our trade. Master what you are taught.

The rules that matter
Loyalty to Lord Orochimaru is absolute. Secrecy is total. Strength is everything. Read
the loyalty notice and the village policies before your first assignment.

You are Sound now. Serve, endure, and grow strong.
